  "openQuestions": [
    "The client has no no-show timer; the server applies 부도처리시점/진료마감부도처리여부. Whether 'N minutes after' is measured from 예약시간 start (as the UI text says) and whether the boundary is >= or > is not visible.",
    "'진료 마감' time source is not in client code (likely clinic hours of that weekday, or the last 시간대 end). Lunch/break and temporary clinic days (임시진료일) handling unknown.",
    "Whether a booking that is already checked in (내원여부) or canceled is skipped is assumed but not visible.",
    "Values other than 10/30/60 (e.g. 45 from old data) display no active button but still drive the text."
  ]
